{"unit_id":"tag:00VI:statement","translation":"（关于集合（set）论问题——初读时可跳过。）\n引入位点（sites）的主要原因，是研究位点（site）上的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category），因为它推广了在代数几何（algebraic geometry）中十分重要的拓扑空间（topological space）上的层（sheaves）所成的范畴（category）。为避免考虑诸如“类（classes）的类（classes）”之类的事物，我们不允许位点（sites）是“大”范畴（categories），这与我们对范畴（categories）和 <MATH_0001>-范畴（categories）的做法不同。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n假设 <MATH_0002> 是一个范畴（category），而 <MATH_0003> 是由覆盖（coverings）构成的真类（proper class），满足上面的 (1)、(2) 和 (3)。我们也不允许将其作为位点（site），主要是因为我们将对覆盖（coverings）取极限（limits）。不过，有几种自然的方法，可以将 <MATH_0004> 替换为覆盖（coverings）的一个集合（set），或替换为一种略有不同的结构，并使其产生相同的层（sheaves）范畴（category）。例如：\n<STRUCT_0003>\n<STRUCT_0004> 在集合论（Sets）第 <REF_0001> 节中，我们说明如何选取覆盖（coverings）的一个适当集合（set），使其给出相同的层（sheaves）范畴（category）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 另一种做法是取相伴拓扑（topology）（见定义 <REF_0002>）。由此得到的 <MATH_0005> 上的拓扑（topology）具有相同的层（sheaves）范畴（category）。两个拓扑（topologies）具有相同的层（sheaves）范畴（categories），当且仅当它们相等，见定理 <REF_0003>。一个范畴（category）上的拓扑（topology），由在各对象（objects）上选取筛（sieves）给出。<MATH_0006> 上所有可能的筛（sieves），甚至所有可能的拓扑（topologies），所成的总体都是集合（set）。\n<STRUCT_0006> 我们也可以稍微修改位点（site）的概念，见下面的注记 <REF_0004>，从而得到覆盖（coverings）的一个典范（canonical）集合（set）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n这些方案各有一些小缺点。对于第一种，必须检查后面的构造不依赖于覆盖（coverings）集合（set）的选择。对于第二种，必须学习拓扑（topologies），并将关于位点（sites）的许多论证重做一遍。对于第三种，见注记 <REF_0005> 的最后一句。\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\n我们的做法是使用上面定义 <REF_0006> 中的位点（sites）。给定一个范畴（category）<MATH_0007>，并带有如上所述的由覆盖（coverings）构成的真类（proper class），我们将利用集合论（Sets）引理 <REF_0007>，将其替换为覆盖（coverings）的一个集合（set），从而得到一个位点（site）。下面的引理 <REF_0008> 说明，所得到的层（sheaves）范畴（category）（即拓扑斯（topos））不依赖于这一选择。读者如有意愿，也可以使用另外两种策略之一处理这些问题。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"集合论及覆盖的集合"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"引入位点及其大小限制"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"单个位点的结构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"位点及拓扑空间上的层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"层所成的范畴"},{"source_term":"algebraic geometry","target_term":"代数几何","context":"层范畴的应用领域"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"层的经典定义域"},{"source_term":"classes","target_term":"类","context":"大小问题中的类的类"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"范畴和2-范畴的大小约定"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖的真类及集合替代"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类","context":"可能过大的覆盖总体"},{"source_term":"limits","target_term":"极限","context":"对覆盖取极限"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论","context":"引用集合论章"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"位点的相伴拓扑"},{"source_term":"topologies","target_term":"拓扑","context":"比较不同拓扑的层范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴中选择筛的对象"},{"source_term":"sieves","target_term":"筛","context":"用筛描述拓扑"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"修改定义得到的覆盖集合"},{"source_term":"topos","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"位点上的层范畴"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00VJ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为拓扑空间（topological space）。设 <MATH_0002> 为如下范畴（category）：其对象（objects）由所有开（open）集合（sets）<MATH_0003>（包含于 <MATH_0004>）组成，而态射（morphisms）就是包含（inclusion）映射（maps）。也就是说，<MATH_0005> 中任意两个对象（objects）之间至多有一个态射（morphism）。现在定义 <MATH_0006> 当且仅当 <MATH_0007>。\n上面的条件 (1) 和 (2) 是显然的；只要注意到在 <MATH_0008> 中有 <MATH_0009>，条件 (3) 也是显然的。特别要注意，空（empty）集合（set）必须是 <MATH_0010> 的一个元素（element），否则一般而言上述做法就行不通。此外，正如我们后面将看到的，同样重要的是允许<TEXTITOPEN_0001>将空（empty）集合（set）的空（empty）覆盖（covering）作为覆盖（covering）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>！\n我们将 <MATH_0011> 变成一个位点（site），做法是选取覆盖（coverings）的一个适当集合（set）<MATH_0012>，如集合论（Sets）引理 <REF_0001> 中所述。预层（Presheaves）和层（sheaves）（定义见下文）在位点（site）<MATH_0013> 上的概念，与拓扑空间（topological space）上的预层（presheaves）和层（sheaves）的通常概念完全一致，后者定义于层（Sheaves）第 <REF_0002> 节。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"Presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"topological space","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"开集位点的底空间"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"以开集为对象的范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"范畴中的开集"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"空间中的开集"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"开集对象"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"开集之间的包含映射"},{"source_term":"inclusion","target_term":"包含","context":"开集的包含"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"作为态射的包含映射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"两个对象之间至多一个态射"},{"source_term":"empty","target_term":"空","context":"空集和空覆盖"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"空集及覆盖集合"},{"source_term":"element","target_term":"元素","context":"空集是范畴中的元素"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"允许空集的空覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"拓扑空间的开集位点"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"选取合适的覆盖集合"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论","context":"引用集合论中的引理"},{"source_term":"Presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"位点上的预层"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"位点和空间上的层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"拓扑空间上的通常预层"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"引用层章"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:00VK:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为群（group）。考虑范畴（category）<MATH_0002>，其对象（objects）是带有左（left）<MATH_0004>-作用（action）的集合（sets）<MATH_0003>，其态射（morphisms）是 <MATH_0005>-等变（equivariant）映射（maps）。一个重要的例子是 <MATH_0006>，它是一个 <MATH_0007>-集合（set），其底集合（set）为 <MATH_0008>，作用（action）由左乘（left multiplication）给出。这个范畴（category）具有纤维积（fiber products），见范畴（Categories）第 <REF_0001> 节。\n我们规定，<MATH_0009> 是一个覆盖（covering），如果 <MATH_0010>。这就给出了 <MATH_0011> 上由覆盖（coverings）构成的一个类（class），容易看出它满足定义 <REF_0002> 的条件 (1)、(2) 和 (3)。所得结构不是位点（site），因为底层范畴（underlying category）的对象（objects）总体和覆盖（coverings）总体各自都构成真类（proper class）。我们首先将 <MATH_0012> 替换为一个完全子范畴（full subcategory）<MATH_0013>，如集合论（Sets）引理 <REF_0003> 中所述。此后，像集合论（Sets）引理中那样适当限制覆盖（coverings）总体而得到的位点（site）<MATH_0014>，其所用引理为 <REF_0004>，记作 <MATH_0015>。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n作为一个特例，如果群（group）<MATH_0016> 是可数的（countable），那么可以令 <MATH_0017> 为由可数（countable）<MATH_0018>-集合（sets）组成的范畴（category），而覆盖（coverings）取为那些联合满射的（surjective）态射族（families of morphisms）<MATH_0019>，且满足 <MATH_0020> 可数（countable）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"left","target_term":"左"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivariant","target_term":"等变"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用"},{"source_term":"left multiplication","target_term":"左乘"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"fiber products","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数的"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"联合满射的"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"带群作用的集合"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"群集所成的范畴"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"带作用的集合对象"},{"source_term":"left","target_term":"左","context":"群的左作用"},{"source_term":"action","target_term":"作用","context":"群在集合上的作用"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"带群作用的集合"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"等变映射作为态射"},{"source_term":"equivariant","target_term":"等变","context":"与群作用相容的映射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"等变映射"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"群集及底集合"},{"source_term":"left multiplication","target_term":"左乘","context":"群在自身上的作用"},{"source_term":"fiber products","target_term":"纤维积","context":"群集范畴中存在的纤维积"},{"source_term":"Categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"引用范畴章"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"像的并覆盖目标"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"位点的覆盖族"},{"source_term":"class","target_term":"类","context":"覆盖的类"},{"source_term":"underlying category","target_term":"底层范畴","context":"构成位点的底层范畴"},{"source_term":"proper class","target_term":"真类","context":"对象和覆盖的大小问题"},{"source_term":"full subcategory","target_term":"完全子范畴","context":"替换过大的群集范畴"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合论","context":"引用集合论的引理"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"缩小后得到的位点"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数的","context":"可数群特例的假设"},{"source_term":"countable","target_term":"可数","context":"可数群集及可数指标集"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"联合满射的","context":"覆盖族联合满射"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族","context":"作为覆盖的态射族"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:07GE:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。有一种典范（canonical）方式将其变成位点（site），其中 <MATHSEG_0001> 是同构（isomorphism）<MATHSEG_0002> 是 <MATH_0002> 的覆盖（coverings）。这个位点（site）上的层（Sheaves）就是 <MATH_0003> 上的预层（presheaves）。相应的拓扑（topology）称为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>混沌的（chaotic）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>或<TEXTITOPEN_0002>不可分拓扑（indiscrete topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌的"},{"source_term":"indiscrete topology","target_term":"不可分拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"赋予混沌拓扑的范畴"},{"source_term":"canonical","target_term":"典范","context":"范畴变为位点的典范方式"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"仅以单个同构为覆盖的位点"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"形成覆盖的态射"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"由同构组成的覆盖"},{"source_term":"Sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"这个位点上的层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"此时层与所有预层一致"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"相应拓扑的名称"},{"source_term":"chaotic","target_term":"混沌的","context":"拓扑名称之一"},{"source_term":"indiscrete topology","target_term":"不可分拓扑","context":"原文给出的另一拓扑名称"}],"notes":[]}
